            "",
            ""
          ],
          [
            "HDIV, \nVDIV",
            "Inverted ratio, must be \nconsistent with Ratio",
            "10-bit fields, used as \nunsigned 10 decimal.\nValid values are \n128 (= inv8x) to \n1023 (= inv1x).",
            "A side parameter, impacts only the \nluminance of the output pixels.\nThe optimal in function of xRATIO is \nxDIV = Floor((1024 * 8192 -1) / xRATIO) \n(x = H or V).",
            "",
